{"slug":"decisions-0003-sync-tags","title":"0003 — Canonical SDK cache tag convention","blocks":[{"id":"b1","type":"ingress","content":[{"type":"text","value":"One convention across SDK and Phoenix webhook dispatcher for cache tags."}]},{"id":"b2","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Status:","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" Accepted 2026-04-19; amended 2026-05-29 (tenancy scoping). Consolidates ADR-0003 + realtime gap-analysis option rationale (attic'd)."}]},{"id":"b3","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Decision"},{"id":"b4","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"One convention across SDK and Phoenix webhook dispatcher:"}]},{"id":"b5","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"type":"text","value":"bp:ds:<dataset>:_all","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" — every fetch in a dataset"}],[{"type":"text","value":"bp:ds:<dataset>:doc:<id>","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" — per-document fetch"}],[{"type":"text","value":"bp:ds:<dataset>:type:<type>","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" — per-type list fetch"}]]},{"id":"b6","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"barkparkFetch","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" auto-tags every published-branch fetch, in order: "},{"type":"text","value":"[bp:ds:<ds>:_all, bp:ds:<ds>:type:<type> (when opts.type), bp:ds:<ds>:doc:<id> (when opts.id), ...userTags, ...knownSyncTags]","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"id":"b7","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Dispatcher emits a "},{"type":"text","value":"4-entry","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"text","value":"sync_tags","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" on every webhook — scoped first, legacy dataset-only retained:"}]},{"id":"b8","type":"code","value":"scoped = \"bp:ws:#{ws_slug}:p:#{project_slug}:ds:#{dataset}\"\nsync_tags: [\"#{scoped}:doc:#{doc_id}\", \"#{scoped}:type:#{type}\",\n            \"bp:ds:#{dataset}:doc:#{doc_id}\", \"bp:ds:#{dataset}:type:#{type}\"]"},{"id":"b9","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"revalidateBarkpark","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" prefers "},{"type":"text","value":"payload.sync_tags","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" verbatim; falls back to canonical tags from "},{"type":"text","value":"{dataset, doc_id, type}","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (or legacy "},{"type":"text","value":"{_id, _type, ids, types}","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"); deduped before "},{"type":"text","value":"revalidateTag","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"id":"b10","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"The four broken points (pre-Task #17)"},{"id":"b11","type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[[{"type":"text","value":"/v1/data/listen/:dataset","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (SSE) sits behind "},{"type":"text","value":":require_token","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" — public browsers can't subscribe without shipping a token."}],[{"type":"text","value":"router.refresh()","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" only invalidates the Router Cache — "},{"type":"text","value":"force-cache","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" fetches stayed stale until "},{"type":"text","value":"revalidateTag","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" ran."}],[{"type":"text","value":"Nothing bridged the SSE event's "},{"type":"text","value":"syncTags","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" to a "},{"type":"text","value":"revalidateTag()","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" call (server-only API)."}],[{"type":"text","value":"revalidateBarkpark","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" emitted "},{"type":"text","value":"barkpark:doc:*","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"text","value":"barkpark:type:*","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" while "},{"type":"text","value":"barkparkFetch","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" registered "},{"type":"text","value":"bp:ds:<ds>:*","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" — zero overlap → silent no-op; dispatcher emitted no tag list at all."}]]},{"id":"b12","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Why Option 1 (webhook-bridge) over 2/3"},{"id":"b13","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"type":"text","value":"Option 2","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" (server-side SSE bridge in Next.js): long-lived process; hostile to serverless/edge; multi-instance Data Cache fragmentation (worker A's revalidate misses worker B). Rejected."}],[{"type":"text","value":"Option 3","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" (client SSE → Server Action): needs a browser-exposed token (no listen-only token type exists); chatty; unauthenticated action endpoint needs rate-limiting. Kept as possible preview-mode add-on."}],[{"type":"text","value":"Option 1","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":": ~4 file edits, no new infra, no browser token, HMAC-signed + dedup'd + retried delivery already existed. Preview/draft pages use "},{"type":"text","value":"cache:'no-store'","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" and stay on "},{"type":"text","value":"<BarkparkLive/>","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" + "},{"type":"text","value":"router.refresh()","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]]},{"id":"b14","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Back-compat guarantees"},{"id":"b15","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"type":"text","value":"revalidateBarkpark({_id, _type, dataset})","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" still works (normalized to canonical tags)."}],[{"type":"text","value":"revalidateBarkpark('id-string')","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" is a "},{"type":"text","value":"silent no-op","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" (a bare id has no dataset context) — pass the webhook payload directly."}],[{"type":"text","value":"Draft branch ("},{"type":"text","value":"cache: 'no-store'","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":") must NEVER set "},{"type":"text","va